 mi-linux-welcome
Description: MI Linux GNOME default settings
 Provides the default MI Linux GNOME wallpaper, dock favorites, extension list,
 lock/login wallpaper synchronization, and desktop preferences. Dependencies
 match the launchers pinned in the default favorites so a fresh install does not
 show broken app icons.
